## Domain Entities (`Modelos/Entidades/`)

| Entity | Key Fields | Notes |
|--------|-----------|-------|
| `Usuario` | Id, Nome, Numero, Email, Senha, Perfil (enum), TenantId | Unique on (TenantId, Numero) where Excluido=false |
| `Agendamento` | Id, UsuarioId, BarbeiroId, ServicoId, DataHora, Status (enum), TenantId | Two-stage via AgendamentoPrincipalId |
| `Servico` | Id, Descricao, Valor, TempoEstimado (TimeOnly), RequerDuasEtapas (bool), TenantId | Uses IRepositorio<Servico> |
| `Mensalista` | Id, UsuarioId, Status, Tipo, TenantId | Monthly subscription |
| `MensalistaCorte` | Id, MensalistaId, DataHora, TenantId | Cut usage log |
| `Adicional` | Id, Nome, Preco, Excluido, TenantId | Uses IRepositorio<Adicional> + cache |
| `AgendamentoAdicional` | AgendamentoId, AdicionalId | Junction table |
| `ConfiguracaoHorario` | DiaSemana, HoraInicio, HoraFim, AlmocoInicio, AlmocoFim, TenantId | Cached 15 min, invalidated on Salvar |
| `ConfiguracaoBarbearia` | Endereco, Telefone, Cidade, TenantId | Establishment details |
| `CodigoConfirmacao` | UsuarioId, Codigo, Expiracao | Email verification codes |
| `Excecao` | Id, UsuarioId, BarbeiroId, Motivo, TenantId | No-show / cancellation log |
| `Tenant` | Id (Guid), Nome, PlanoId | Barbershop establishment |
| `TenantDominio` | Id, Dominio, TenantId, Autorizado | Domain → Tenant mapping |
| `Plano` | Id, Nome, MaxBarbeiros | Subscription plan |

**Soft delete:** `Excluido: bool = false` on most entities. Always filter `x.Excluido == false`.

