---

## Infrastructure (`Infraestrutura/`)

### DbContext (`Infraestrutura/Contexto/Contexto.cs`)
- Single DbContext, `ApplyConfigurationsFromAssembly`
- `ContextoFactory` for design-time migrations

### Repository (`Infraestrutura/Repositorios/`)
- `IRepositorio<T>`: `Query()`, `ObterPorIdAsync()`, `AdicionarAsync()`, `Atualizar()`, `Remover()`, `SalvarAsync()`
- `Repositorio<T>`: wraps `DbSet<T>` from `Contexto`
- Registered as open-generic in Program.cs

### Middlewares
- **`ExceptionMiddleware`** — catches exceptions; in Production returns generic message; in Development returns `ex.Message`. Logs with Method+Path context.
- **`TenantValidationMiddleware`** — validates Origin, injects TenantInfo, returns 403 if invalid/inactive

### Multi-Tenancy
- **`ITenantService` / `TenantService`** — resolves TenantId from `HttpContext.Items`
- **`ITenantValidationService` / `TenantValidationService`** — validates domains, caches (10 min)

### Security (`Infraestrutura/TokenProvider.cs`)
- JWT generation, claims: `Id`, `Numero`, `Nome`, `Perfil`; 12h expiry; HMAC-SHA256

### Performance Indexes (migration 20260406000000_AddPerformanceIndexes)
- `Agendamentos (TenantId, BarbeiroId, DataHora)` — primary query path
- `Agendamentos (TenantId, UsuarioId)`
- `Agendamentos (TenantId, Status)`
- `Mensalistas (TenantId, Status)`

---

## Helpers (`Aplicacao/Helper/`)

### `HelperGenerico.cs`
- `MontarHorariosPorConfig(ConfiguracaoHorario)` — appointment slots from DB config
- `GerarSlots()` / `GerarSlotsContinuos()` — with/without lunch break
- `GerarCodigoConfirmacao()` — 4-digit codes
- `GerarDiasAgenda(TipoAgenda)` — date ranges per schedule type
- `RemoveMask(string)` — strips non-numeric chars

> `EnviarMensagem` was removed — use `IWhatsappService.EnviarMensagemAsync()` instead.

### `Criptografia.cs`
- `GerarSenha(string)` — PBKDF2 SHA-256, 100k iterations, returns `hash:salt`
- `VerificarSenha(senha, hash)` — constant-time comparison

---

## Key Business Logic

### Two-Stage Services (`RequerDuasEtapas = true`)
- Stage 1: standard booking
- Stage 2: auto-created with minimum hour gap after stage 1
- `AgendamentoPrincipalId` on stage-2 links to stage-1 Id
- Stage 2 status = `SlotReservado`

### Appointment Slot Generation
- `ConfiguracaoHorario` per weekday (HoraInicio→HoraFim, with optional AlmocoInicio/AlmocoFim)
- `HelperGenerico.MontarHorariosPorConfig()` → `List<TimeOnly>`
- Cached 15 min per tenant; cache invalidated on Salvar

### Monthly Subscription (Mensalista)
- Each cut logged as `MensalistaCorte`
- Status-based filtering; plan limits barber count

### Pagination
- `PaginacaoFiltro<T> { Pagina, ItensPorPagina, Filtro }` on request
- `PaginacaoResultado<T> { Items, TotalRegistros, PaginaAtual, ItensPorPagina }` on response

