## Configuration (`appsettings.json` keys)

```json
{
  "CorsOrigins": ["https://...", "http://localhost:3000"],
  "ConnectionStrings": { "DefaultConnection": "<PostgreSQL Neon>" },
  "Jwt": { "Secret": "...", "Issuer": "GsSytem", "Audience": "Account" },
  "Email": { "From": "...", "Host": "smtp.gmail.com", "Username": "...", "Password": "..." },
  "Whatsapp": { "Verify_Token": "...", "Token": "...", "endpoint": "https://graph.facebook.com/v22.0/{id}/messages" },
  "Apis": { "ConfiguracaoBaseUrl": "http://..." }
}
```

Override any key via environment variable (double-underscore separator):
`Jwt__Secret=...` | `ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=...`

Swagger available only in non-Production environments.
Health check: `GET /health`

---

## Deployment

- **Dockerfile:** multi-stage, .NET 10 SDK build → ASP.NET 10 runtime, port 8080
- **docker-compose.yml:** pulls `ghcr.io/saulo0100/barbeariarocha:latest`, Traefik HTTPS on `barbearia-api.cloud`
- **CI/CD:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — on push to master: build → publish → Docker push to GHCR

---

## Conventions & Patterns

- **Portuguese naming** throughout (entities, services, methods, variables)
- **Repository pattern** — use `IRepositorio<T>` for new code; existing services use `Contexto` directly (migrate on touch)
- **Soft delete** via `Excluido: bool` — never hard-delete
- **All entities have TenantId** — always scope queries: `.Where(x => x.TenantId == tenantId)`
- **DTOs** — never expose entities directly; use Request/Response models
- **Pagination** on all list endpoints
- **EF Fluent API only** — no data annotations; all in `Infraestrutura/Mapping/`
- **Async** — `IWhatsappService` is async; new services should prefer async throughout
- **No secrets in appsettings.json** — use environment variables in production (see `.env.example`)

---

## Known State

- WhatsappController is an empty shell — not yet implemented
- TestesController exposes destructive endpoints — should be protected/removed in production
- Services not yet on IRepositorio: AgendamentoApp, AutenticacaoApp, UsuarioApp, MensalistaApp, RelatorioApp, HorarioApp, TokenApp, EmailApp, ExcecaoApp, ConfiguracaoBarbeariaApp, TenantAdminApp
- No automated tests exist in this repository
- Migration history: 20260228 (initial) → 20260406 (performance indexes)
